  "682d73da8058660cdaf1ee5a": "You MUST complete Immunity's first quest.",
  "675d2f6b653dc8ff1b42218a successMT": "*The story will now continue*... In the next update! In the meantime, continue with the side quests and level up your player skills!",
  "675d2f6b653dc8ff1b42218a acceptMT": "Gotta play the game, I guess",

