  "6954ad7fc3ef9ad06b0e88c3 name": "BONUS QUEST: Questionable Visitors",
  "6954ad7fc3ef9ad06b0e88c3 description": "I've noticed you have a spot for... other people to deliver you items? That's strange, are they maybe sent by the traders? Hmm... well, I guess we'll see what happens. Tell you what, I'll keep watch for you while you're out and about. I'll let you know what happens.",
  "6954adc1c3ef9ad06b0e88c5": "Collect from the Scav case 15 times",
  "6954adc1c3ef9ad06b0e88c6": "Collect from the Cultists 15 times",
  "6954ad7fc3ef9ad06b0e88c3 successMT": "...just so you know, the cultists don't come and collect your offerings. It gets burnt up in a fire and replaced with something else. It's like something out of Exodus, it concerns me. The scavs are quite nice at least, they drop off random stuff, sometimes valuable too. They show up drunk sometimes, though... what's up with that?",
  "6954ad7fc3ef9ad06b0e88c3 acceptMT": "No accept MT for bonus quests",

  "683523269fc8b5139db451f3 name": "BONUS QUEST: Too much damage (Combat tier 1)",
  "683523269fc8b5139db451f3 description": "Look at you, getting your start in all of the weapon catagories! Very well done. Let's start something early, then... you like seeing numbers go up, right? Good, this should be fun. 200K damage, ok?. ...Yep. On you go.",
  "6835232ab51c9b64034184ad": "Inflict 250000 damage total. This will take a long time.",
  "683523269fc8b5139db451f3 successMT": "Oh, you actually did it. I lost count around 100k, sorry... uhm, well done? I wonder how long this took.",
  "683523269fc8b5139db451f3 acceptMT": "No accept MT for bonus quests",

  "683524416e49ef54cc64a861 name": "BONUS QUEST: Too much ammo (Combat tier 2)",
  "683524416e49ef54cc64a861 description": "Your aim is getting pretty good, it seems. Shall we do some accuracy with volume, then? Hmm. Don't forget that each pellet in a buckshot round counts, if you are gonna try to actively do this one.",
  "68352445c66f48d06ec80bba": "Hit 12000 shots. This will take a long time.",
  "683524416e49ef54cc64a861 successMT": "I wonder... did this one take longer or shorter than the first? No matter. The next one, you will not be completing.",
  "683524416e49ef54cc64a861 acceptMT": "No accept MT for bonus quests",

  "6835250e562778985a76f019 name": "BONUS QUEST: Too much challenge (Combat tier 3)",
  "6835250e562778985a76f019 description": "Did you enjoy all of those custom challenges I had for you? I spent quite a while coming up with them (and coding them, 4th wall break). In fact, they were *so* fun, what if we did them all again? ...You know there's a catch. You get five lives to do it. On the fifth death, the quest fails, and you restart. I'll track for you, don't worry. ...And yes, the number are reduced. You're welcome.",
  "683528a6747c2110267b20be": "Complete all of the following in five lives:",
  "683528a58a3411d3429d1787": "Kill 15 enemies over 20 meters away with 2x sights",
  "683528a5b720452e45239cf9": "Kill 7 enemies within 15 meters with an Assault rifle.",
  "683528a4898e8f0c0cf11137": "Kill 7 enemies beyond 80 meters with an Assault rifle.",
  "683528a4f400fc842f9af438": "Kill 7 enemies with DMRs in one raid (No damage limit for this one...)",
  "683528a3f36110f3c15298f7": "Kill 15 enemies while mounted with an LMG",
  "683528a32ea45127bde5d1f5": "Hit an enemy in the head with a melee weapon 5 times",
  "683528a27ad51ac8d995a01c": "Kill 5 enemies within 20 meters with pistols",
  "683528a2283a1c5fa0319fe8": "Kill 15 enemies with revolvers while point / hip firing",
  "683528a1e59754c49624b7c4": "Kill 5 enemies with revolvers while wearing the Kinda Cowboy hat",
  "683528a16764fbd0580bb748": "Deal 500 damage to enemy armour with shotguns",
  "6835289d221dafab89e919fe": "Destroy ('black') 20 enemy legs with SMGs",
  "6835289da1c004d9882e3eda": "Accumulate 2000 total shot distance with sniper rifles",
  "6835289cd0b02b5a38bca8c6": "Kill 2 stunned enemies",
  "6835289c28b3fc24352834f9": "Clear a malfunction from an Assault Rifle (or Carbine)",
  "6835289b8d00b70dc484bc28": "Clear a malfunction from a Designated Marksman Rifle",
  "6835289b56e2b4ac78c0970c": "Clear a malfunction from a Light Machine Gun (only RPK-16 can jam!)",
  "6835289abcec959767b7eb79": "Clear a malfunction from a Pistol",
  "6835289aa8a7a0231bd161ca": "Clear a malfunction from a Shotgun",
  "6835289979c51e34781a38f9": "Clear a malfunction from a Sub Machine Gun",
  "68352899ce9d3dc88415afd8": "Clear a malfunction from a Sniper rifle",
  "68355aa4fe08bad8a1c981d3": "Kill an enemy over 60 meters away with an UBGL",
  "68352eed1ecbbf1895c923c0": "Death counter (DON'T LET IT REACH 5!)",
  "6835250e562778985a76f019 successMT": "...You're still doing these? I really didn't think you would get through this one, even with multiple lives. Hmm. Your combat abilities surpass what should be possible... ...You know what's coming next, right?",
  "6835250e562778985a76f019 acceptMT": "No accept MT for bonus quests",

  "68352605229be6dbd7ea88bc name": "BONUS QUEST: Too much Birdeye (and other annoying bosses) (Combat tier 4)",
  "68352605229be6dbd7ea88bc description": "Y'know, I thought of doing a 'snowball' type thing for this, or maybe repeating every tier 4 challenge like we did for tier 3... but eh, you're already far more advanced here than you should be. So just kill a lot of them. You get four lives this time. I'll track again.",
  "6835260c812164b436894516": "Kill 40 bosses in four lives.",
  "6835656f60be019d2cd4b4ea": "Death counter (Don't let it reach 4...)",
  "68352605229be6dbd7ea88bc successMT": "Such dedication... For what? Are your combat skills not all elite at this point? Get off the game, my friend... drink some water, get some sun.",
  "68352605229be6dbd7ea88bc acceptMT": "No accept MT for bonus quests",

  "683527167a6b9ad628721c5e name": "BONUS QUEST: Too much Tarkov (Combat tier 5)",
  "683527167a6b9ad628721c5e description": "Alright, sicko. You still wanna continue? You still want to complete quests for combat experience? YOU'RE AT MAX LEVEL BY NOW. Why do you continue... Alright, fine. I've assigned a weapon class to each map. You're gonna be here until wipe day. ... ...Oh fine, I won't do streets. But you're going to the Lab to make up for it.",
  "683529d2baaf8f364b0ea0d2": "Kill 500 enemies on Lighthouse with Assault Rifles",
  "683529d1bd516b93f9afc05e": "Kill 500 enemies on Shoreline with DMRs",
  "683529d17600a20d0e4d6cd6": "Kill 500 enemies on Interchange with Light Machine Guns",
  "683529d2ef7a6f28703ceb77": "Kill 500 enemies on Ground Zero with Pistols",
  "683529d2031ba2afbe9b8650": "Kill 500 enemies on Reserve with Revolvers",
  "683529d0b615b44891c43a34": "Kill 500 enemies on Factory with Shotguns",
  "683529d0f5ad6853aac798dd": "Kill 500 enemies on Customs with SMGs",
  "683529d3745a8af846c09523": "Kill 500 enemies on Woods with Sniper Rifles",
  "683529f60a9c5e8e32299072": "Kill 500 enemies on Lab (with any weapon!)",
  "68356d5c913244c9ef2ad6c8": "Kill 100 enemies with grenades (on any map!)",
  "683527167a6b9ad628721c5e successMT": "...Horrifying. Absolutely horrifying. Close the game. Depart from me. Do something else with your life.",
  "683527167a6b9ad628721c5e acceptMT": "No accept MT for bonus quests",

  "686b74c829c66ea678c9a5a2 name": "BONUS QUEST: A Real Loyalty Buyout",
  "686b74c829c66ea678c9a5a2 description": "You know how Skier has some tasks where you just hand him a bunch of money? Yeah, kinda dumb. So I thought, 'Hey, what if you did something like that for the other traders, but it actually benefitted you in some way?' Like, you're not just handing over money because they said so, but you're actually purchasing stuff from them? So, how about you do just that. Spend the equivalent of 2 million roubles with the 7 core traders. ...actually, skip Skier. He doesn't deserve it.",
  "686b7552e52f30705b3c6a45": "Spend 2 million roubles on Prapor",
  "686b769381faf5e1e759483d": "Spend 2 million roubles on Therapist",
  "686b7694cf516c5171fe923b": "Spend 2 million roubles on Peacekeeper",
  "686b76949f1938f4a506c991": "Spend 2 million roubles on Mechanic",
  "686b76953a342f455905c4ed": "Spend 2 million roubles on Ragman",
  "686b7695b0356774f27295a1": "Spend 2 million roubles on Jaeger",
  "686b74c829c66ea678c9a5a2 successMT": "Wow, that was a lot of money. Was the gear worth it?",
  "686b74c829c66ea678c9a5a2 acceptMT": "No accept MT for bonus quests"
}